<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-27T00:38:52.461Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Philippine Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded when explosives detonated inside their Zamboanga City barracks, and two other Coast Guard members were injured in a separate blast at the same location. The AFP monitored a Chinese aircraft carrier and militia vessels transiting near Mindanao and Zamboanga coasts, stating the passage was not a cause for alarm. The Philippines, United States and Japan completed their 22nd multilateral maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea, continuing joint drills in the area. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOS0EzN1hNNVZRUUlvY0R5LTRMVG9iOHEwWWpRRmZlZ2xlNi1oT01nWTl0MVVFX3NETEFtbDdqMHl3bXVrWjllR3UwZnJqMDljTV9vLTdyUl9Vd1BXWlhTWl9xZi1oaVdVYl9vTlcwd1RUUkxsV2k4ZmU5WWVwSjVnb1lXMzZTcndrclY5ajBLQWU3cGlyZkR4OVVwTEhYQ2Raa2EzelBsQVFZT0pQejRJeHFzc1lyOTA2am5hTDZYeUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABS-CBN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5MeFR4MThsczQ3TEkxMzJoSE9WMThuVFB3R2lNVUZsTjdRV2kzTXRLaTdtRzJaQm5sRTh2TjJETkgyUGY5QUdxUXp2X2FxNHF4amxTX1d0bHNKOWpHbEhheDlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPdndkbzFlTWNmTjhwSm94REhGU1M0Qy1oenRsUUZkN1UyX3FtR1RqUWtTckRUcVJRcUtxTE1qWHFpVVd6SHI3NXlET2FDS2kxaDNKZmlsakVZZHk5ZEFWRVd1RkVpSlBZRFlWbmo2Vm1rcDFUTUlaaWZFNldzaVh5RHRtYjVIeFB5a181ajdVLUI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Defensehere&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNQjRob0hrLXVmVExUWXdyS0ViaDFXS3JIMmNlc19kZXVKOURJR3JoREpGUEN2ZDBKYWxmcFFZVXJISlRISVVFQUNiS3JOT2F0RTVubUoxbmVadWxNQnJ6N1J5OXVJeFEyVkttd1A4dHdTRlBZX3M2MDdSSHNycDdUQ0RmOXhOVDQ0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOWX